Just a little bit more,
and I will be able to avenge you, my mother.

11
00:01:34,988 --> 00:01:37,896
If that day comes, I will let you kill that
damn beast with your own hands.

12
00:01:38,112 --> 00:01:39,684
Yes, the song is the key.

13
00:01:39,768 --> 00:01:42,248
So now we are left with the tenth victim.

14
00:01:42,476 --> 00:01:46,780
We need to get the list from Mr. Pakin
and compare it with the occupation like last time.

15
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:52,908
Hey, are you a star? Why don't I know you?

16
00:01:53,512 --> 00:01:57,756
Hey, Sergeant! This person is very famous.
He's famous all the way to China.

17
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,868
