I saw a man.

102
00:07:47,892 --> 00:07:51,112
The man is dying. The man is dying.

103
00:07:51,924 --> 00:07:53,812
Is this the man, Sky?

104
00:07:54,196 --> 00:07:56,072
Is this the man, Sky?

105
00:07:57,484 --> 00:07:59,252
Yes, yes.

106
00:07:59,748 --> 00:08:03,276
This man is dying. This man is dying.

107
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:06,560
Die, must die, he is dying.

108
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:09,832
Lan, Sky is showing symptoms.

109
