Sky is an autistic child, so she can't explain
what she's seeing in her head.

154
00:13:47,096 --> 00:13:49,448
Does Fah know what Sky is thinking?

155
00:14:00,904 --> 00:14:01,600
One dead,

156
00:14:02,312 --> 00:14:03,392
Another one was not caught.

157
00:14:04,092 --> 00:14:04,968
It's no good.

158
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,900
- Who is the murderer who died?
- Yes, sir.

159
00:14:10,436 --> 00:14:11,220
Keng,

160
00:14:11,496 --> 00:14:12,856
Karan Homdrun.

161
00:14:16,124 --> 00:14:21,440
Oh, the population register said he had killer genes,
but the test results from the body said otherwise.

162
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:23,980
