171
00:14:47,252 --> 00:14:49,272
Because Tali was the victim that
the murderer wanted to kill.

172
00:14:49,324 --> 00:14:50,724
Yeah, I know.

173
00:14:51,064 --> 00:14:53,864
Then why didn't you let the undercover police go instead?

174
00:14:54,072 --> 00:14:56,784
If something really happens to him,
can you take responsibility for it?

175
00:14:57,188 --> 00:14:59,460
- Well, then it's fake, sir.
- Don't talk back to me.

176
00:15:00,596 --> 00:15:02,700
Your job now is to catch the criminal.

177
00:15:03,088 --> 00:15:05,296
And don't let anyone else die.

178
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:06,840
Yes, sir.

179
00:15:08,844 --> 00:15:09,480
Oh, then

180
00:15:11,152 --> 00:15:13,956
How is that actor doing now?
Isn't he being attacked by mobs?

181
00:15:16,072 --> 00:15:18,240
I'd like to interview you. Please let us interview.

182
00:15:18,428 --> 00:15:19,500
How are you, Tali?

183
00:15:19,844 --> 00:15:23,400
How are you? Last night was a big deal.
Were you injured in any way?

184
00:15:23,492 --> 00:15:27,524
Oh, everything is much better now. And then...

185
00:15:27,852 --> 00:15:30,968
I would like to thank the police team
for taking such good care of me.

186
00:15:31,036 --> 00:15:33,636
Otherwise, I would have been killed.

187
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:37,264
Really, I have to thank the police very much,

188
00:15:37,556 --> 00:15:39,428
