189
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:44,776
If there's anything I can help you with, please tell me.
You can also tell Ta. I'm happy and willing to do so.

190
00:15:44,852 --> 00:15:48,596
The killer will only choose victims who have killer genes.

191
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:51,620
So, does Tali also have the killer gene?

192
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:55,500
Yes, I do.

193
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:58,704
I have killer genes.

194
00:15:59,112 --> 00:16:03,396
And now, all of my matters are under the care of the police.

195
00:16:03,864 --> 00:16:06,300
I was wrong, so I have to accept the mistake.

196
00:16:07,180 --> 00:16:10,848
In reality, Ta doesn't know anything about it.

197
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:15,468
It was me who did it.

198
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:18,168
The one who is at fault is me.

199
00:16:18,824 --> 00:16:19,928
It's okay, mom.

200
00:16:20,496 --> 00:16:25,888
Just imagine if one day your
child was branded as a murderer,

201
00:16:26,664 --> 00:16:28,960
even though he just opened his eyes to the world.

202
00:16:29,372 --> 00:16:32,624
As a mother, how would I accept this?

203
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:39,704
He has done good deeds and done great things for others.

204
00:16:40,556 --> 00:16:42,104
Is this the kind of person

205
00:16:42,984 --> 00:16:45,268
who is going to get up and kill people?

206
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:49,820
It is a killer gene law that is still being revised.

207
00:16:50,576 --> 00:16:51,840
What is up with this law?

208
00:16:51,956 --> 00:16:53,208
It's not fair at all.

209
00:16:53,464 --> 00:16:54,712
Let me ask you this honestly.

210
00:16:55,068 --> 00:16:58,576
Can good and evil really be determined by genes?

211
00:17:00,332 --> 00:17:01,436
It's okay, Mom.

212
00:17:08,784 --> 00:17:09,380
Sir,

213
00:17:09,896 --> 00:17:12,436
