221
00:18:26,424 --> 00:18:27,536
What's up?

222
00:18:29,492 --> 00:18:30,772
The backlash, sis.

223
00:18:32,328 --> 00:18:35,916
Instead of people criticizing
Tali for faking the killer genes,

224
00:18:36,628 --> 00:18:38,708
