225
00:18:40,172 --> 00:18:42,184
Isn't it good to end that way?

226
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:43,912
Who said that?

227
00:18:44,580 --> 00:18:46,744
The person who got attacked instead is...

228
00:18:48,456 --> 00:18:49,516
Dr. Chonlathorn.

229
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:53,276
Well, it's Tali's fan club.

230
00:18:55,436 --> 00:18:56,428
They really cursed him.

231
00:18:59,644 --> 00:19:01,328
I'm Dr. Chonlathorn Traikanon,

232
00:19:02,828 --> 00:19:04,460
Prime Ministerial Candidates,

233
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:07,528
on behalf of the Palang Pracha Thai Progressive Party

234
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:10,616
I feel sorry for the serial murders that happened.

235
00:19:11,156 --> 00:19:14,972
I would like to express my condolences
to those who lost loved ones.

236
00:19:15,580 --> 00:19:16,836
Including parents,

237
00:19:17,644 --> 00:19:20,212
all the relatives of those who lost loved ones.

238
00:19:21,024 --> 00:19:22,644
Many people may be focusing on the issue

239
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,800
of the Genetic Killer Act.

240
00:19:25,112 --> 00:19:28,960
I was the one who pushed for and enforced this law.

241
00:19:29,784 --> 00:19:34,780
I still insist that what I did was for society's safety.

242
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,304
The situation over the past twenty years,

243
00:19:38,116 --> 00:19:41,528
we can see that our society is peaceful.

244
00:19:42,104 --> 00:19:43,704
There have been no serious cases.

245
00:19:44,188 --> 00:19:46,672
Everyone can stay at home with warmth.

246
00:19:47,628 --> 00:19:49,456
Until this unavoidable incident occurred.

247
00:19:51,776 --> 00:19:52,824
Which is why I

248
00:19:54,288 --> 00:19:55,676
cannot be certain that

249
00:19:56,652 --> 00:19:59,048
this may be just a political discrediting move.

250
00:20:00,104 --> 00:20:01,180
Or is there anyone

251
00:20:01,752 --> 00:20:03,276
behind this murder case.

252
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:11,020
In my pure intentions,
I may have been distorted by a group of people.

253
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:17,356
And it is accused of being degrading
and obstructing humanity. Therefore,

254
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:20,592
to take full responsibility

255
00:20:22,624 --> 00:20:26,096
I would like to resign as party leader
and prime ministerial candidate

256
00:20:26,548 --> 00:20:27,920
