257
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:06,712
Everything you've done is for this, right, Fah?

258
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:18,616
We did it, Keng.

259
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:23,824
We knocked that damn Dr. down.

260
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:26,188
What a shame, Keng,

261
00:21:27,004 --> 00:21:28,780
